{"type":"text","timestamp":1793453852807,"sessionID":"ses_e6dd2b2cdffea0lCRWrtgZSDuh","part":{"id":"prt_1922def75001xgHCgRqysP8CYU_text-0","sessionID":"ses_e6dd2b2cdffea0lCRWrtgZSDuh","messageID":"msg_1922def75001xgHCgRqysP8CYU","type":"text","text":"[goal] Fix the failing integration test by finding all root causes per docs. [action] Ran the suite, read docs + relevant modules, fixed two bugs, re-ran. [result] `python -m unittest discover -s tests -t .` → `Ran 13 tests ... OK`.\n\nRoot causes:\n\n1. **Config precedence inverted** — `arena_server/config/loader.py:13-22`: `load_config` applied the JSON file *after* environment variables, so the file overrode env. docs/CONFIG.md requires `DEFAULTS < JSON file < env`. Effect: `ARENA_KILL_BONUS=75` was silently replaced by the file's `50`, giving payout 1440 instead of 1590. Fixed by loading the file first, then applying env vars on top.\n\n2. **Credits lost on save/load** — `arena_server/persistence/codec.py:13`: `decode` rebuilt the `Profile` without `credits`, so every reload reset credits to the dataclass default 0 (visible symptom: `0 != 1690`). Fixed by passing `credits=data.get(\"credits\", 0)`.\n\nPayout math itself (`arena_server/economy/payout.py`) already matched docs/ECONOMY.md (round to nearest ten, halves up: 1275 x 1.25 = 1593.75 -> 1590), so it needed no change. No tests were modified.","time":{"start":1793453846400,"end":1793453852807}}}
